{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳車Cam片，今日天水圍發生一單撞車意外，有一輛私家車沿朗天路往天水圍方向行駛，期間疑失控撞向中線的水馬。片中所見，車輛撞向水馬後在空中翻滾至少5圈，再四輪朝天掛在水馬上。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-26-16h38m41s303.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20268E2BLRoxcz1787733592.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-26-16h38m41s303.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-26-16h38m42s650.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026IXWbCPVHnZ1787733616.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-26-16h38m42s650.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據知，有途人見狀報警，一度懷疑有人被困車內，人員接報到場證實無人被困及受傷，未發現私家車司機蹤影。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"784622304_3549358568552660_468768891410639973_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20262LZexNvRFH1787733633.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"784622304_3549358568552660_468768891410639973_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T08:59:45.375289+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}